# Human AI

Read `.cursor/rules/ai.mdc` first — shared law for every brain, English only.
This file is human-only. Agent `ai` currently works on birds; open this layer
only when a human-brain task card exists.

The brain decides **what** the human wants. Balance is `BalanceController`.
Torques come only from `Muscle` and `JointFriction`.

The human is a `LivingOrganism`, a **sibling** of Bird, not its child.
Vision and hearing: `.cursor/rules/ai.mdc` (**See and hear**). Life state
(`Sleep` / `Wake` and Wake kinds): the same file (**Life state**).
`MotionIntent` is how Wake is asked of the body, not a second tree.
Do not use `VestibularSystem` as eyes or `CameraFollow` as sight.

Factions: read `.cursor/rules/ai.mdc` (Factions, Attitude). This file
does not invent a second law. The human brain reads `FactionMember` /
`FactionTable` and writes only `MotionIntent`. Hostility is avoidance,
not a punch.

## Layer

| Writes | Does not write |
|---|---|
| `MotionIntent.moveX` / `crouch` / `standLeg` / `lean` / `run` | `AddForce` / `AddTorque` |
| `StepPhaseDriver.ArmWalk` / `EndWalk` | PD gains, muscles, segment sizes |
| `OrganismVoice.Cry` (same bus as the bird; no human card yet) | mixer as ears |
| its own perception fields (distance, target) | `Human`, balance sensors |

Human sensors (`VestibularSystem`, `CenterOfMassCalculator`,
`BodyStateEstimator`) are read-only (balance). Vision and hearing are
the organism senses in `ai.mdc`, not these.

## Who sits on which body

- Index 0 is the player: `MotionIntent` + `StepPhaseDriver` + `PlayerInputSource`.
- Everyone else is AI: the same `MotionIntent`, no keyboard.
- `GameProcess` currently attaches intent only when `i == 0`. Hanging a brain
  on the others is this layer, not physics.

`HeadlessTrial` sets intent itself. Do not mix AI into the human stand
unless a card says so.

## Rate and budget

Poll and decide in `Update` (same as `PlayerInputSource`). In `FixedUpdate`
do nothing except let the balancer read intent already written.

A full ragdoll is the hero — 1–2 on screen. Do not spawn a crowd of `Human`.
Do not run the brain at 200 Hz.

## Scenes

Play is `World`. Do not touch `SampleScene`. Do not spawn birds.

## Forbidden

No invisible upward force. Do not start SIMBICON.
Do not change `jointAngle` signs or muscle caps. Do not start a new stand
baseline. No human-brain task card — do not write this layer.
